---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Worldbuilding on Urth',
  description: 'Free Pax States and the Kilumi conlang on Urth.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <Fragment slot="announcement" />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <p class="font-mono2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase opacity-60">URTH // FIELD NOTES — FILE 02</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl mt-3">Worldbuilding</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-muted mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      Building Urth — a world of fractured nations, living languages, and quiet revolutions.
    </p>

    <div class="emjay-card rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 mt-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <p class="font-mono2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase" style="color: var(--emjay-stamp)">
          ▚ Free Pax States
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono2 text-[11px] opacity-50">STATUS: MAPPING</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        A loose confederation born after the Pax collapse. Not a country — a network of
        city-states, trade routes, and mutual-defense pacts trying to stay free in a world that
        keeps centralizing.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-5 text-[15px] space-y-0 border-t emjay-rule">
        <li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2.5 border-b emjay-rule">
          <span><strong>Political structure</strong> — council of envoys, no standing army</span>
          <span class="font-mono2 text-xs opacity-50 shrink-0">POL</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2.5 border-b emjay-rule">
          <span><strong>Culture</strong> — maker-first, archive-obsessed, skeptical of empires</span>
          <span class="font-mono2 text-xs opacity-50 shrink-0">CUL</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2.5 border-b emjay-rule">
          <span><strong>Current focus</strong> — mapping the border towns and their treaties</span>
          <span class="font-mono2 text-xs opacity-50 shrink-0">MAP</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2.5 border-b emjay-rule">
          <span><strong>Showcase portal + Census Office</strong> — live-synced from the census sheet</span>
          <a class="font-mono2 text-xs opacity-70 shrink-0 hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="https://github.com/EmjayBot/free-pax-states" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GITHUB →</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="emjay-card rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 mt-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <p class="font-mono2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase" style="color: var(--emjay-stamp)">
          ◐ Kilumi — Conlang of Urth
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono2 text-[11px] opacity-50">LEXICON 205</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Kilumi is the trade tongue of the southern archipelagos. Agglutinative, vowel-harmony,
        built for clarity over poetry — though it has plenty of both.
      </p>
      <div class="font-mono2 mt-5 rounded-xl border emjay-rule p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto">
        <p><span class="opacity-50">kilu-mi</span> [trade.tongue] <span class="opacity-50">— n.</span> shared trade language</p>
        <p><span class="opacity-50">pax-suri</span> [pax.breach] <span class="opacity-50">— n.</span> the collapse; lit. "pax-broken"</p>
        <p><span class="opacity-50">-na / -ti</span> [seen / heard] <span class="opacity-50">— ev.</span> evidentiality suffixes</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="mt-5 text-[15px] space-y-0 border-t emjay-rule">
        <li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2.5 border-b emjay-rule">
          <span><strong>Phonology</strong> — 5 vowels, 14 consonants, no tones</span>
          <span class="font-mono2 text-xs opacity-50 shrink-0">PHON</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2.5 border-b emjay-rule">
          <span><strong>Grammar</strong> — SOV, case stacking, evidentiality markers</span>
          <span class="font-mono2 text-xs opacity-50 shrink-0">GRAM</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2.5 border-b emjay-rule">
          <span><strong>Status</strong> — working lexicon, grammar sketch in progress</span>
          <span class="font-mono2 text-xs opacity-50 shrink-0">WIP</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm italic opacity-70">More lexicon entries and short fiction coming soon.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-sm">
      <a href="/blog" class="font-semibold hover:underline underline-offset-4">Read the field log →</a>
      <span class="mx-2 opacity-40">·</span>
      <a href="/xcf-sync" class="font-mono2 text-sm hover:underline underline-offset-4">$ open xcf-sync</a>
      <span class="mx-2 opacity-40">·</span>
      <a href="/powercordkit" class="font-mono2 text-sm hover:underline underline-offset-4">⌁ powercordkit</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
